    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira agisenga yatura, arira yubamye imbere y’Ingoro y’Imana, abantu benshi b’Abisirayeli, abagabo, abagore n’abana, bakoranira aho ari. Na bo nyene bararira cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Shekaniya mwene Yehiyeli, umwe wo mu bakomoka kuri Elamu, abwira Ezira ati: “Ntitwabaye abizigirwa imbere y’Imana yacu mu kurongora abagore b’abanyamahangakazi dukuye mu mahanga adukikije. Ariko naho bimeze uko, haracariho ivyizigiro ku Bisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubu rero, nimuze dusezeranire imbere y’Imana yacu, twemere kwirukana abo bagore bose n’abana babo, nk’uko wewe nyakwubahwa ubiduhanura n’abandi bose bahindira agashitsi imbere y’amabwirizwa y’Uhoraho Imana yacu. Kandi tubikore twisunze ivyagezwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haguruka; iki kibazo kiri mu maboko yawe. Natwe turagushigikiye, komera kandi ubikore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Ezira aca ava hasi arahiza abakuru mu baherezi n’Abalewi n’Abisirayeli bose ngo bakore ivyo vyavuzwe. Bose bararahira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Ezira aca ava imbere y’Ingoro y’Imana aja mu cumba ca Yehohanani mwene Eliyashibu. Ari ngaho, ntiyariye ikintu na kimwe kandi ntiyanyoye n’amazi, kuko yabandanije agandaye kubera ubuhemu abavuye mu kinyago bagize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko babimenyesha mu Buyuda hose n’i Yerusalemu ngo abagarutse bavuye mu kinyago bakoranire hamwe i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese atashoboye kuboneka mu misi itatu yaca anyagwa itongo ryiwe, nk’uko vyari vyashinzwe n’abatware hamwe n’abakuru b’imiryango, kandi na we nyene ubwiwe agaca akurwa mw’ikoraniro ry’abagarutse bavuye mu kinyago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu misi itatu, abagabo bose b’i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini bari bakoraniye i Yerusalemu, maze ku musi wa mirongo ibiri w’ukwezi kw’icenda, abantu bose bari bicaye mu kibuga c’Ingoro y’Imana, batetemera kubera iyo ngorane hamwe rero n’imvura nyinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Ezira umuherezi arahaguruka arababwira ati: “Ntimwabaye abizigirwa; mwarongoye abagore b’abanyamahangakazi, mwongereza ku bibi Abisirayeli bari barakoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero nimwaturire ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana ya ba sogokuruza icaha canyu, kandi mukore ivyo agomba. Mwitandukanye n’abanyamahanga mubana n’abagore mwazanye b’abanyamahangakazi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikoraniro ryose ririshura n’ijwi rirenga riti: “Uvuze ukuri! Turakora nk’uko uvuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko hano hari abantu benshi kandi ni mu gihe c’imvura; kubera ivyo ntidushobora guhagarara hanze. Ikigeretse kuri ivyo, ibi ntibishobora gutunganywa ku musi umwe canke ibiri, kuko twakoze icaha gikomeye mu gukora ivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatware bacu nibabikore mu gishingo c’ikoraniro ryose. Maze umuntu wese wo mu bisagara vyacu yarongoye umunyamahangakazi mu gihe kinaka cemejwe, azoze azananye n’abakuru n’abacamanza bo mu gisagara kimwe cose, kugira ngo uburake bw’inkazi bw’Imana yacu bwatewe n’iyi ngorane bushobore kutuvako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatani mwene Asaheli na Yahizeya mwene Tikuva ni bo bonyene bagwanije iyo ngingo, bashigikiwe na Meshulamu na Shabetayi Umulewi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abatahutse bavuye mu kinyago bakora nk’uko bagiriwe inama. Ezira umuherezi atoranya abagabo bari abakuru b’imiryango, umw’umwe mu muce w’umuryango, kandi abagabo bose babavuga mu mazina. Ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’icumi baricara ngo bige ivyo bintu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi kugeza ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa mbere baraheza kwihweza ivyerekeye abagabo bose bari barongoye abagore b’abanyamahangakazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
